given k: int(1..3)
given n: int(4..6)
find p: partition (numParts k) from int(1..n)
find bounded: partition (minNumParts k, maxNumParts (sum([k,1;int(1..)])), minPartSize 1, maxPartSize ((n - 1))) from int(1..n)
find regularPartition: partition (partSize k, regular) from int(1..n)
find f: function (minSize k, maxSize (sum([k,1;int(1..)]))) int(1..n) --> int(1..n) 
find r: relation (size (sum([k,1;int(1..)]))) of (int(1..n) * int(1..n))
find perm: permutation (minNumMoved k, maxNumMoved (sum([k,1;int(1..)]))) of int(1..n)

